<title>USA: Texas A&amp;M to sell $64 mln bonds on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Texas A&amp;M to sell $64 mln bonds on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texas A&amp;M University has scheduled a $64.25 million competitive bond issue for Wednesday at 1400 EDT, the university's financial adviser, First Southwest, said Tuesday.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
